# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the context root's
# .dockerignore, which is how this build excludes a local working tree without
# adding a file to the repository root.
#
# The context is the repository root, and a local tree there can hold a
# gigabyte of compiled artifacts, virtual environments and shards. None of it
# belongs in an image, and all of it would be uploaded to the daemon first.
.git
.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
kernel/target
shards
dirs
results
infra
docs
*.md
